{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-03-17 09:05:00', 'title': "SYNOPSYS LAUNCHES INDUSTRY'S FIRST COMPLETE IP SOLUTION FOR PCI EXPRESS 6.0", 'text': "MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., MARCH 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HIGHLIGHTS: DESIGNWARE CONTROLLER, PHY AND VERIFICATION IP SUPPORTS THE LATEST FEATURES IN THE PCI EXPRESS 6.0 SPECIFICATION, ENABLING EARLY SOC DEVELOPMENT LOW-LATENCY CONTROLLER WITH NEW MULTISTREAM ARCHITECTURE DELIVERS UP TO 2X THE THROUGHPUT OF A CONVENTIONAL PCI EXPRESS CONTROLLER HIGH-PERFORMANCE PHY IN 5-NM PROCESS WITH UNIQUE ANALOG AND DSP TECHNIQUES PROVIDES 20 PERCENT LESS POWER ACROSS CHIP-TO-CHIP, RISER CARD AND BACKPLANE INTERFACES COMPREHENSIVE SET OF PROTOCOL, METHODOLOGY AND PRODUCTIVITY FEATURES ENABLE RAPID VERIFICATION OF PCI EXPRESS 6.0 DESIGNS SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE INDUSTRY'S FIRST COMPLETE IP SOLUTION FOR THE PCI EXPRESS® (PCIE®) 6.0 TECHNOLOGY THAT INCLUDES CONTROLLER, PHY AND VERIFICATION IP, ENABLING EARLY DEVELOPMENT OF PCIE 6.0 SYSTEM-ON-CHIP (SOC) DESIGNS."}